# llama.cpp cross-build tree for the on-device engine (build-llama.cmd). Cached and
# reused across runs, hence kept in-tree rather than in a temp dir; ~24 MB of objects.
# `**/build` above does not catch it — the name neither equals nor starts with "build".
# The assembled SDK it copies out to lives outside the repo (D:\opt\llama-sdk-ohos-*).
